                    "text": "2 : 1",
                    "math_alt": [],
                    "plain_text": "2 : 1"
                },
                "C": {
                    "text": "3 : 4",
                    "math_alt": [],
                    "plain_text": "3 : 4"
                },
                "D": {
                    "text": "3 : 25",
                    "math_alt": [],
                    "plain_text": "3 : 25"
                },
                "E": {
                    "text": "4 : 3",
                    "math_alt": [],
                    "plain_text": "4 : 3"
                },
                "F": {
                    "text": "25 : 3",
                    "math_alt": [],
                    "plain_text": "25 : 3"
                }
            },
            "correct_answer": "C",
            "correct_answer_raw": "3 : 4",
            "correct_answer_plain": "3 : 4",
            "correct_answer_images": [],
            "explanation": "Method 1\nTurn Q : R  =  5 : 2 into a unitary ratio where R = 1, by dividing both sides of the ratio by 2.  Q : R then becomes 2.5  :  1\nTurn R : S  =  3 : 10 into a unitary ratio where R = 1, by dividing both sides of the ratio by 3.  R : S then becomes 1 : 10/3\nNow it is easier to see the relationship between Q and S: if Q is 5/2, then R is 1 ; and if R is 1, then S is 10/3.\nSo if Q is 5/2, then S is 10/3.  In other words, the ratio Q : S  =  5/2 : 10/3\nConverting this to a whole-number ratio by multiplying both sides by 6 gives Q : S  =  15 : 20\nSimplifying this ratio by dividing both sides by 5 gives Q : S  =  3 : 4\nMethod 2\nQ : R  =  5 : 2\nMultiplying both sides of this ratio by 3 gives Q : R  =  15 : 6\nR : S  =  3 : 10\nMultiplying both sides of this ratio by 2 gives R : S  =  6 : 20\nNow it is easier to see the relationship between Q and S: if Q is 15, then R is 6 ; and if R is 6, then S is 20.\nSo if Q is 15, then S is 20.  In other words, the ratio Q : S  =  15 : 20\nSimplifying this ratio by dividing both sides by 5 gives Q : S  =  3 : 4",
            "explanation_images": [],
            "extracted_at": "2026-07-04T23:44:55.388206",
            "options_latex": {
                "A": "1 : 2",
                "B": "2 : 1",
                "C": "3 : 4",
                "D": "3 : 25",
                "E": "4 : 3",
                "F": "25 : 3"
            }
        },
