            "explanation": "The total age of the original members = 20 x 28 = 560\nThe mean age of the new group = 28 + 2 = 30\nThe total age of the new group = 30 x 22 = 660\nThe total age of the 2 new members = 660 – 560 = 100\nThe mean age of the new members = 100 ÷ 2 = 50 years\nSo, the correct answer is 50 years.",
            "explanation_images": [],
